sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant MobileApp as "Mobile App"
    participant Backend as "Backend API"
    participant Scraper as "Web Scraper"
    participant Geocoder as "Geocoding Service"
    participant Store as "Store Location"

    User->>MobileApp: Adds product to Reminder List
    MobileApp->>Backend: POST /api/reminders (Reminder List)
    Backend->>Scraper: Search for stores selling product
    Scraper->>Store: Fetch search results, extract addresses
    Scraper->>Geocoder: Send addresses for geocoding
    Geocoder-->>Scraper: Return lat/lon coordinates
    Scraper-->>Backend: Return store coordinates
    Backend-->>MobileApp: Return store coordinates
    MobileApp->>MobileApp: Register geofences for stores
    User->>MobileApp: Moves near a store
    MobileApp->>MobileApp: Detects geofence entry
    MobileApp-->>User: Sends push notification ("You are near a store with your item!") 